      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/MMDA/status/2019241461007675760",
      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY: The Department of Public Works and Highways (DPWH) has started conducting road works at the following locations in Quezon City and will last until February 28:\n\n🚧 Ayala Street (from Aurora Boulevard to Buendia): Rehabilitation and upgrading of damaged paved roads\n\n🚧 Quezon Avenue (from Hi Top Supermarket to before BIR Road): Preventive maintenance\n\n🚧 Aurora Boulevard, Eastbound (from G. Araneta/Cubao area to 20th Avenue, and from PSBA/C5 Katipunan Avenue to the Quezon City and Marikina boundary): Preventive maintenance\n\nPlan trips accordingly and expect potential delays in these areas.\n#MMDA #mmdaatyourservice #TrafficAdvisory",
